  0.1.0 — the thin caller for bamr87/bamr87 .github/workflows/standard-ci.yml.
  Verified 2026-08-09: rendering this template with a target's default branch
  reproduces all 20 deployed callers byte-for-byte, so the fleet is in sync.
notes: |
  Identity is byte-comparison against this template (rendered with the target's
  default branch) plus any archive/ci-*.yml shapes — the same mechanism the
  prose and agent-context kits use. When the caller shape changes, snapshot the
  outgoing version into archive/ FIRST; otherwise every deployed copy reads as
  hand-modified and `--upgrade` skips it. The gate LOGIC lives in
  .github/workflows/standard-ci.yml and is versioned there, not here — changing
  it needs no fan-out at all.
